# Copy to .env (which is never committed) and fill in what this project uses.

# Optional: a Lark base that mirrors BACKLOG.md. Leave these unset on a small or one-person
# project; nothing will ask for them.
# LARK_BASE_TOKEN=
# The row for this repository in the base's Products table, or in its Projects table. One of the two.
# LARK_PRODUCT=
# LARK_PROJECT=
